Fires a wave of projectiles in a radius [5, 5, 6, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] cone, dealing [105%, 120%, 131%, 141%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage. All targets struck by this will be knocked back to the maximum range of the cone and stunned for [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns.

Each target struck has a 20% chance to be marked.

The chance to knockback and stun increases with your Accuracy.
